---

<BaseLayout title="소개" description="SunJae.Log를 쓰는 사람과 이 블로그가 다루는 범위입니다." source="src/pages/about.astro">
  <article class="prose prose-page">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <Cmd command="kubectl describe engineer" />
      <h1>소개</h1>
    </header>
    <section class="describe-panel" aria-label="엔지니어">
      <dl class="describe-list">
        <div>
          <dt>Name</dt>
          <dd>박선재 <span class="muted">SunJae Park</span></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Handle</dt>
          <dd><code>{site.author}</code></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Role</dt>
          <dd>Cloud-Native Platform Engineer <span class="muted">클라우드 네이티브 플랫폼 엔지니어</span></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Labels</dt>
          <dd class="chip-row">
            <span class="label-chip">kubernetes</span>
            <span class="label-chip">observability</span>
            <span class="label-chip">istio</span>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Notion</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href={notionUrl} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">이력서 · 포트폴리오</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Email</dt>
          <dd>
            {
              site.email.map((address) => (
                <div>
                  <a href={`mailto:${address}`}>{address}</a>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <h2 id="career">경력사항</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Today's me is just my own successful past in the future.</p>
    <div class="career-stage" data-career-stage>
      <ol class="timeline timeline--reveal" data-timeline-reveal>
        {
          career.map((item) => (
            <li
              class={`timeline-item${item.status === '재직 중' ? ' timeline-item--current' : ''}`}
              data-career-item
              data-company={item.company}
              data-role={item.role}
              data-org={item.org}
              data-period={`${item.from} – ${item.to}`}
              data-status={item.status}
              data-summary={item.summary}
              data-highlights={JSON.stringify(item.highlights)}
              tabindex="0"
            >
              <span class="timeline-year">{item.from.slice(0, 4)}</span>
              <span class="timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true" />
              <span class="timeline-body">
                <span class="timeline-title">
                  {item.company}
                  <span class={`timeline-status${item.status === '재직 중' ? ' timeline-status--current' : ''}`}>
                    {item.status}
                  </span>
                </span>
                <span class="timeline-sub">{item.role}</span>
                <span class="timeline-meta">
                  {item.from} – {item.to}
                </span>
              </span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
      <aside class="career-preview" data-career-preview hidden>
        <p class="career-preview-kicker" data-career-preview-org></p>
        <p class="career-preview-title" data-career-preview-company></p>
        <p class="career-preview-role" data-career-preview-role></p>
        <p class="career-preview-period" data-career-preview-period></p>
        <p class="career-preview-summary" data-career-preview-summary></p>
        <ul class="career-preview-points" data-career-preview-points></ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <p>
      클라우드와 인프라를 운영합니다. Kubernetes 위에서 서비스를 올리고, 메트릭·로그로 상태를 보고, 장애가 나면
      원인을 좁히는 일을 합니다. 최근에는 그 과정에 LLM을 어디까지 끼워 넣을 수 있는지도 같이 봅니다.
    </p>
    <p>
      SunJae.Log는 그 작업 메모를 다음에 그대로 쓸 수 있게 정리하는 곳입니다. 주제는 글마다 붙이고, 글이 늘어나도
      주소 체계는 그대로 둡니다. 해본 프로젝트는 <a href="/projects/">프로젝트</a>에 모아 두었습니다.
    </p>
    <h2>주로 다루는 것</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Kubernetes와 배포</li>
      <li>관측 가능성 — 메트릭, 로그, 트레이스</li>
      <li>장애 원인 분석</li>
      <li>LLM을 곁들인 운영</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id="certs">자격사항</h2>
    <ul class="record-cards">
      {
        certifications.map((item) => (
          <li class={`record-card${item.image ? ' record-card--with-image' : ''}`}>
            {item.image && (
              <span class="record-thumb">
                <img src={item.image} alt={`${item.name} 자격증`} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </span>
            )}
            <span class="record-body">
              <span class="record-name">{item.name}</span>
              {item.full && <span class="record-sub">{item.full}</span>}
              <span class="record-meta">
                <span class="record-org">{item.org}</span>
                <time class="record-date">{item.issued}</time>
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <h2>학력사항</h2>
    <ol class="timeline">
      {
        education.map((item) => (
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-year">{item.to.slice(0, 4)}</span>
            <span class="timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span class="timeline-body">
              <span class="timeline-title">{item.school}</span>
              <span class="timeline-sub">{item.kind}{item.major ? ` · ${item.major}` : ''}</span>
              <span class="timeline-meta">
                {item.from} – {item.to}
                <span class="timeline-status">{item.status}</span>
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
    <h2 id="awards">수상</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">대회에서 받은 상입니다.</p>
    <ul class="record-cards award-cards">
      {
        awards.map((item) => (
          <li class="record-card record-card--award">
            <span class="record-body">
              <span class="award-badge" aria-hidden="true">Award</span>
              <span class="record-name">{item.title}</span>
              <span class="record-sub award-result">{item.result}</span>
              <span class="record-meta">
                <span class="record-org">{item.org}</span>
                <time class="record-date">
                  {item.from} – {item.to}
                </time>
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <h2 id="activities">활동사항</h2>
    <ul class="record-cards">
      {
        activities.map((item) => (
          <li class="record-card">
            <span class="record-body">
              <span class="record-name">{item.title}</span>
              <span class="record-sub">{item.role}</span>
              <span class="record-meta">
                <span class="record-org">{item.org}</span>
                <time class="record-date">
                  {item.from} – {item.to}
                </time>
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <p>
      자격·경력·학력·수상·활동 전체는 <a href={notionUrl} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">Notion 이력서</a>에서도 볼 수 있습니다.
    </p>
    <p>
      운영자: {site.author}<br />
      연락:{' '}
      {
        site.email.map((address, index) => (
          <>
            {index > 0 && ' · '}
            <a href={`mailto:${address}`}>{address}</a>
          </>
        ))
      }
    </p>
  </article>

  <script>
    const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    const items = document.querySelectorAll('[data-timeline-reveal] .timeline-item');
    if (!items.length) {
      // nothing
    } else if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
      items.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('is-visible'));
    } else {
      const io = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            io.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        },
        { rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px', threshold: 0.2 },
      );
      items.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));
    }

    const stage = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-stage]');
    const preview = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview]');
    if (stage && preview) {
      const elOrg = preview.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview-org]');
      const elCompany = preview.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview-company]');
      const elRole = preview.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview-role]');
      const elPeriod = preview.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview-period]');
      const elSummary = preview.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview-summary]');
      const elPoints = preview.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-career-preview-points]');
      const rows = () => [...stage.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-career-item]')];

      const hide = () => {
        preview.hidden = true;
        rows().forEach((row) => row.classList.remove('is-active'));
      };

      const show = (row: HTMLElement) => {
        rows().forEach((r) => r.classList.toggle('is-active', r === row));
        if (elOrg) elOrg.textContent = row.dataset.org ?? '';
        if (elCompany) elCompany.textContent = row.dataset.company ?? '';
        if (elRole) elRole.textContent = row.dataset.role ?? '';
        if (elPeriod) {
          const status = row.dataset.status ? ` · ${row.dataset.status}` : '';
          elPeriod.textContent = `${row.dataset.period ?? ''}${status}`;
        }
        if (elSummary) elSummary.textContent = row.dataset.summary ?? '';
        if (elPoints) {
          elPoints.replaceChildren();
          let points: string[] = [];
          try {
            points = JSON.parse(row.dataset.highlights ?? '[]');
          } catch {
            points = [];
          }
          for (const point of points) {
            const li = document.createElement('li');
            li.textContent = point;
            elPoints.append(li);
          }
        }
        preview.hidden = false;
      };

      for (const row of rows()) {
        row.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => show(row));
        row.addEventListener('focus', () => show(row));
      }
      stage.addEventListener('mouseleave', (event) => {
        const to = event.relatedTarget as Node | null;
        if (to && stage.contains(to)) return;
        hide();
      });
      stage.addEventListener('focusout', () => {
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          if (!stage.contains(document.activeElement)) hide();
        });
      });
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
